OL,3,GNEWSAGuided busway section closed for
OL,4,A'urgent repairs'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA section of Cambridge's guided busway
OL,7,Fwill be closed for almost four days to
OL,8,Fallow for urgent repairs to be carried
OL,9,Fout.
OL,11,FCambridgeshire County Council said the
OL,12,Fsouthern section, between Clay Farm and
OL,13,FTrumpington Park and Ride, would be
OL,14,Fclosed from 23:00 BST on Thursday until
OL,15,FMonday afternoon, 12 October.
OL,17,FIt said engineers identified a defect
OL,18,Faffecting a structural beam between
OL,19,FHauxton Road bridge and Shelford Road
OL,20,Fbridge and a temporary 10mph (16km/h)
OL,21,Fspeed restriction was introduced,.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
